\begin{abstract}
AstroElementa Engine v4.0 is a unified astrophysical computation platform
integrating fully homomorphic encryption (FHE), relativistic Dirac--Coulomb--Breit
electronic structure solvers, extended periodic table modeling up to $Z = 172$,
and large-scale nucleosynthesis networks. We present complete verification
including CKKS noise budget analysis, relativistic orbital collapse behavior,
r-process yield accuracy across 8,042 isotopes and 81,420 reaction channels,
and full laboratory stress testing across FPGA, GPU, and CPU subsystems.
All modules passed validation.
\end{abstract}